00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:00.600
Creano una policy

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:01.760
scelgono numeri sensati

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:02.500
l'assegnano a tutti

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:03.720
